					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I wanted to upvote it because it's so well done for what it is. That said, <em>I really don't like what it is</em> mostly because it's been done several times but also because one of my last experiences on City of Heroes was dealing with a group who &quot;knew the truth&quot; and thus their character backgrounds <strong>overrode the canon of the game</strong>. Yes, it involved angels and humans intermarrying.</p> <p>I think it balanced out to a no-vote&#8230; The kind of thing that gets an instinctive smack, followed by a heartfelt apology and a cookie.</p> 
				 	]]>
